---
description: RUMA UI/UX design rules
globs: ["**/*.{tsx,jsx,css,scss}"]
---

RUMA uses a premium modern family OS design language.

Primary foundation:
- Soft UI Evolution

Structure:
- Minimalism & Swiss

Selective composition:
- Bento Box Grid for dashboards

AI:
- AI-Native UI for RUMA AI surfaces

Warmth:
- subtle Organic Biophilic influence

Avoid:
- cartoonish/clay UI
- excessive gradients
- excessive shadows
- noisy dashboards
- generic corporate finance aesthetics

Read docs/07_UI_GUIDELINES.md before creating significant UI.
